Sval: about:processes in a normal window shows nothing of a private window

The page lists each process with the site it serves and, under it, every
document with its address and its tab's title. A private window's sites and
pages were listed in any window that opened the page. Nothing outside a
private window says what it has open, so the page opened in a normal window
names no site for a private window's process and lists none of a private
window's documents. SvalPrivateProcesses decides both.

